### 应急无线电演练通联日志互证服务 —— 请求示例
### 可直接用 IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 执行。
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@drill = DRILL-2026

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### 创建演练（允许时差 10 秒，非负；非法负值返回 422）
POST {{host}}/drills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drill_id": "{{drill}}",
  "allowed_time_diff_seconds": 10
}

### 查询演练状态
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}

### 单条写入/更正日志（路径上的记录号优先；时间必须带时区）
PUT {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs/R1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_no": "R1",
  "station": "BH1AAA",
  "counterpart": "BH2BBB",
  "time": "2026-10-04T08:00:00+08:00",
  "band": "40m",
  "mode": "SSB"
}

PUT {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs/R2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_no": "R2",
  "station": "BH2BBB",
  "counterpart": "BH1AAA",
  "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:05+00:00",
  "band": "40m",
  "mode": "SSB"
}

### 批量写入（整体事务；任一条非法或批次内记录号重复则整批拒绝）
POST {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logs": [
    {
      "record_no": "R3",
      "station": "BH3CCC",
      "counterpart": "BH4DDD",
      "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00",
      "band": "40m",
      "mode": "SSB"
    },
    {
      "record_no": "R4",
      "station": "BH4DDD",
      "counterpart": "BH3CCC",
      "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:08+00:00",
      "band": "40m",
      "mode": "SSB"
    }
  ]
}

### 查看全部日志
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs

### 批量写入预演（只读）：不改变日志/锁定/结果/版本/快照
### 返回当前版本 current_result、拟写入 proposed_result、
### 配对增删/同对时差变化/未配对增删（changes）、规范化批次与校验标识 token。
### 非法记录 422、批内记录号重复 409、锁定失效 409、已封存 409（均整批报错）。
# @name rehearse
POST {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs/rehearse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logs": [
    {
      "record_no": "R5",
      "station": "BH5EEE",
      "counterpart": "BH6FFF",
      "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00",
      "band": "40m",
      "mode": "SSB"
    },
    {
      "record_no": "R6",
      "station": "BH6FFF",
      "counterpart": "BH5EEE",
      "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:06+00:00",
      "band": "40m",
      "mode": "SSB"
    }
  ]
}

### 确认预演提交：回传同一批次 + 预演的 base_version + token
### 标识不匹配 409 rehearsal_token_mismatch；
### 预演后版本已变 409 rehearsal_version_conflict；
### 预演后演练已封存 409 drill_sealed。成功则按批量写入语义原子落库，
### 同内容重传不推进版本；响应与 POST /logs 完全一致。
@token = {{rehearse.body.token}}
@base = {{rehearse.body.base_version}}
POST {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/logs/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logs": [
    {
      "record_no": "R5",
      "station": "BH5EEE",
      "counterpart": "BH6FFF",
      "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:00+00:00",
      "band": "40m",
      "mode": "SSB"
    },
    {
      "record_no": "R6",
      "station": "BH6FFF",
      "counterpart": "BH5EEE",
      "time": "2026-10-04T00:00:06+00:00",
      "band": "40m",
      "mode": "SSB"
    }
  ],
  "base_version": {{base}},
  "token": "{{token}}"
}

### 查询互证结果（配对 + 未配对 + 版本 + 总时差）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/result

### 锁定一对互证候选（记录号顺序任意，服务端内部升序）
### 仅接受：现存、相互指认、波段/模式相同、时差不超允许值，
### 且两条记录均未被其他锁定占用。锁定强制入选结果（即使拉低全场配对数）。
PUT {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/locks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_a": "R1",
  "record_b": "R2"
}

### 重复锁定同一对（含颠倒顺序）视为重传：200，版本不推进
PUT {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/locks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_a": "R2",
  "record_b": "R1"
}

### 查询锁定清单及最新互证结果
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/locks

### 解除已有锁定（不存在则 404 lock_not_found；顺序同样任意）
POST {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/locks/unlock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "record_a": "R1",
  "record_b": "R2"
}

### 版本快照：列出已留存版本号（创建即有 0；升级前旧版本不出现）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots

### 取回指定版本快照（配对/未配对/总时差/锁定清单；未留存版本 404 snapshot_not_found）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots/0

### 比较两个已留存版本：配对/未配对/锁定的新增移除 + 同一对时差变化单列
### 相同版本（如 /snapshots/2/diff/2）合法且差异全空
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots/0/diff/1

### 封存演练（封存后写入与锁定操作均返回 409，查询仍可用；封存不产生新快照）
POST {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/seal

### 封存后仍可回看任意已留存版本（sealed 字段从现态读取为 true）
GET {{host}}/drills/{{drill}}/snapshots/1
